{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52502","headline":"谒诸葛祠 · 刘希夷","name":"谒诸葛祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云何其高，明月不可系。\n灼灼抱此心，与世自泾渭。\n释来从所欢，感乱亦歔欷。\n咨惟今之人，窃国未云耻。\n白首入吴市，秋风恐燕水。\n区区袁与曹，等是刺客耳。\n而我於其间，秉义不敢坠。\n袁音回衡飈，清义动幽邃。\n天心固难亮，吾独信所履。\n溶溶日间云，漠漠点寒砌。\n饥鼯堕苍瓦，澹薄公所憇。\n静然想英姿，孤怀亦差𢠢\n（《道藏辑要》本明诸葛曦基辑《汉丞相诸葛忠武侯集》卷十二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}